	(text "LCD (Sharp LS013B7DH03, spec LCP-1112045)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 45.72 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e2e79ef9-400a-5cc9-86be-3ae3e27e4a30"))
	(text "Buffers: SN74LV4T125 (SCLS749C) VIH 1.35 V max at VCC 3.0-3.6 V, so MCU/RTC highs from VBAT down to ~2.0 V\ntranslate cleanly; dIcc 1.5 uA max; Ioff 5 uA max with VCC = 0. SN74LV1T34 (SCLS743E) VIH 1.39 V max.\nOutputs are unpowered whenever VLCD is off, so no LCD input can sit above its VDD.\nFirmware keeps LCD_SCLK/SI/SCS/DISP low and RTC CLKOUT off (low) while VLCD is off.\nSCLK: LCD max 1.1 MHz (0.5-1.1 MHz, rise/fall <= 50 ns); buffer tpd ~5 ns. EXTCOMIN 1 Hz (1-60 Hz allowed).\nEXTMODE = H (pin 8 to VLCD): COM inversion from EXTCOMIN. VSS and VSSA to GND.\nC20 follows Sharp Figure 9-1 (0.1 uF DISP to VSS). It slows DISP edges far past the 50 ns tr spec;\nDISP is a static on/off line, but confirm with Sharp or leave C20 unfitted if DISP misbehaves." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 152.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "62c40b19-8d58-5e35-bd15-32ea48e6171e"))
